# Training videos. ~151 MB across four files — about 99% of everything this
# repository tracked, paid for by every clone and every CI checkout, for content
# no code imports. They stay on disk and belong in Firebase Storage or a CDN.
# Untracking does not shrink history; the existing 151 MB is still in there.
Vedio/

